  "RQ2 llm_used": "GPT-4o; Llama 3.1-405B",
  "RQ2 adaptation": "Default PentestGPT prompts for GPT-4o; modified prompts for Llama; summary injection, structured generation, and RAG over HackTricks using bge-large, ChromaDB, and bge-reranker",
  "RQ3 autonomy_level": "LLMs suggest actions and commands; neither model completed a single end-to-end penetration testing experiment without failure, even with human assistance",
