  "RQ4 baseline_type": "Comparison of LLMs using PentestGPT; base PentestGPT versus cumulative ablations",
  "RQ4 headline_result": "Llama 3.1-405B outperformed GPT-4o on 7 machines, tied on 4, and performed worse on 2; neither gained root-level privileges on any machine without failure",
  "RQ4 compared_to": "PentestGPT with GPT-4o; PentestGPT with Llama 3.1-405B; base model, Summary Injection, Structured Generation, and RAG configurations",
